---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The path"
  description="How The Soul Searchers thinks about choosing, waiting, and walking without a full map."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="site-shell path">
      <p class="eyebrow">The path</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">A few markers for the road</h1>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Not rules — reminders. Keep what fits. Leave the rest on the trail for someone else.
      </p>

      <ol class="markers">
        <li>
          <h2>Trust the next honest step</h2>
          <p>You don’t need the whole map. You need the ground under one foot.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h2>Peek, don’t panic</h2>
          <p>
            Curiosity is allowed. Tear the wrapping only when you’re ready — small peeks count.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h2>Wrong turns still teach</h2>
          <p>Sometimes the “wrong” path is the only one that could have shown you the door.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h2>Write it down</h2>
          <p>The journal is part of the search. A sentence today can steady a year.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/journal">Read the journal</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/about">About the search</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .path {
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  .markers {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: marker;
  }

  .markers li {
    position: relative;
    padding: 1.5rem 0 1.5rem 3.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(215, 224, 232, 0.12);
    counter-increment: marker;
  }

  .markers li::before {
    content: counter(marker, decimal-leading-zero);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 1.55rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  .markers h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .markers p {
    margin: 0;
    color: rgba(215, 224, 232, 0.78);
  }

  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }
</style>
